{"4950700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dust Rapture", "steam_appid": 4950700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Cole Vance</strong>, a long-haul truck driver crossing the endless highways of Route 66. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After weeks on the road, you push through the exhaustion with one promise in mind, to make it home in time for your anniversary. Sleep finally catches up with you on a forgotten stretch of Route 66.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you wake, your truck has been stripped of its vital parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nowhere else to turn, your only hope lies in the abandoned town of <strong>Iron Creek</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The desert is unforgiving. Manage your <strong>health</strong> and <strong>thirst</strong> as you search for food, water, and supplies. Every decision matters when civilization is miles away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scavenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of Iron Creek to uncover tools, vehicle parts, keys, and supplies. Not every door is unlocked, and some places are hiding more than forgotten memories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fear the Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When darkness falls, Iron Creek changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Blake Family</strong> and their fanatical cult emerge to hunt anyone foolish enough to remain outside. Stay hidden, keep moving, and survive until dawn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the Truth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Creek wasn't abandoned without reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the town's disturbing history through notes, audio and abandoned locations. Every discovery brings you closer to the truth—and deeper into the nightmare.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape Before Time Runs Out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Dust Rapture</strong> is approaching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every passing hour, your chances of escape grow slimmer. Repair your truck, survive the horrors of Iron Creek, and make it back to the highway... before the dust consumes everything.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Cole Vance</strong>, a long-haul truck driver crossing the endless highways of Route 66. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After weeks on the road, you push through the exhaustion with one promise in mind, to make it home in time for your anniversary. Sleep finally catches up with you on a forgotten stretch of Route 66.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you wake, your truck has been stripped of its vital parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nowhere else to turn, your only hope lies in the abandoned town of <strong>Iron Creek</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The desert is unforgiving. Manage your <strong>health</strong> and <strong>thirst</strong> as you search for food, water, and supplies. Every decision matters when civilization is miles away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scavenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of Iron Creek to uncover tools, vehicle parts, keys, and supplies. Not every door is unlocked, and some places are hiding more than forgotten memories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fear the Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When darkness falls, Iron Creek changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Blake Family</strong> and their fanatical cult emerge to hunt anyone foolish enough to remain outside. Stay hidden, keep moving, and survive until dawn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the Truth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Creek wasn't abandoned without reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the town's disturbing history through notes, audio and abandoned locations. Every discovery brings you closer to the truth—and deeper into the nightmare.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape Before Time Runs Out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Dust Rapture</strong> is approaching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every passing hour, your chances of escape grow slimmer. Repair your truck, survive the horrors of Iron Creek, and make it back to the highway... before the dust consumes everything.</p>", "short_description": "Stranded on Route 66 after your truck is stripped for parts, explore the abandoned town of Iron Creek, survive its horrors, evade a murderous cult, and escape before it consumes everything.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950700/a8e270b98772a1d6202b28242da489b8aceae66b/header.jpg?t=1788215702", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950700/2666c95b90ec4685f7f6e7b8d0d0bf4085390143/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788215702", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950700/2666c95b90ec4685f7f6e7b8d0d0bf4085390143/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788215702", "website": "https://darkshiftinteractive.com/dust-rapture.html", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 6400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA Geforce GTX 1050 Ti / AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 12400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 5060 / AMD Radeon RX 9060 <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": 